# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for zachtong/zachtong (GitHub profile README repository)
#
# Note: this repo is also built and deployed by
# .github/workflows/jekyll-gh-pages.yml, so anything committed here is
# published. Keep local tooling state and backups out.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local AI / editor tooling state. Not part of the public profile.
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Timestamped local backups. Kept on disk, never published.
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.orig
*~

# Jekyll build output, in case the site is ever built locally.
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.jekyll-metadata
Gemfile.lock
vendor/

# OS and cloud-sync junk.
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: CLAUDE.md holds a personal profile used to brief AI assistants.
# Everything in it is already public (position, publications, contact), but
# uncomment the line below to keep it out of the public repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLAUDE.md
